WEBVTT

00:08:58.492 --> 00:09:00.536
or just through my daily gym workouts.

00:09:00.578 --> 00:09:02.663
Vecause when people
can get beyond the fact

00:09:02.663 --> 00:09:04.748
that HIV is no longer a death sentence,

00:09:04.748 --> 00:09:08.794
and that on effective medication,
it can become undetectable in your body,

00:09:08.794 --> 00:09:12.298
which means it's untransmissible
through sexual contact,

00:09:12.339 --> 00:09:14.341
then people living with HIV

00:09:14.341 --> 00:09:17.428
can live without fear
of rejection or alienation.

00:09:17.845 --> 00:09:19.221
And so the fight continues,

00:09:19.263 --> 00:09:21.682
because in some countries
around the world,

00:09:21.682 --> 00:09:23.767
new cases of HIV are rising,

00:09:23.809 --> 00:09:26.729
and in all of these countries,
stigma continues to exist.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:30.024
I guarantee you,
one day, we'll reach our goal.